  "zh": "# 国常会稳市股市飙升，电视广告取消，官媒警惕AI问诊，大厂劳资冲突，巴航天员入驻天宫\n## 行业动向\n- **国常会稳市 AH股集体飙升**：国务院常务会议定调稳市场，国家队入场提振信心，A股与港股双双大涨。\n- **海康威视取消大小周引抵制**：取消大小周虽合规但薪资缩水，员工反映实际工时未减反增，引发劳资博弈。\n- **大疆竞业协议范围引热议**：大疆竞业限制范围极广，离职员工半年内不能从事相关行业，被指过度垄断人才。\n## 社会民生\n- **电视开机广告正式取消**：广电总局新规生效，电视开机不再强制播广告，用户体验大幅改善。\n## AI 与科技\n- **人民日报提醒勿信AI问诊**：官媒点名批评将大模型当医生风险，提醒公众就医仍需专业医师。\n- **OpenAI发布物理领域重磅论文**：OpenAI最新论文用AI辅助物理发现，展示大模型在基础科学研究新范式。\n## 国际视野\n- **巴基斯坦航天员入驻天宫**：巴基斯坦成首个派遣航天员赴中国空间站国家，标志中巴航天合作深化。",
  "en": "# State Council boost sparks rally, TV boot ads banned, state media warns on AI diagnosis, tech giants face labor disputes, OpenAI advances AI science, Pakistani astronaut joins Tiangong\n## Industry Trends\n- **State Council Stabilizes Market AH Stocks Surge**: The State Council's market-stabilizing tone triggered a rally in both A-shares and Hong Kong stocks as the \"national team\" stepped in.\n- **Hikvision Cancels Alternating Weeks Sparks Protest**: Hikvision's shift to a standard workweek cut pay without reducing hours, prompting employee backlash.\n- **DJI Non-Compete Clause Sparks Debate**: DJI's unusually broad non-compete bars ex-staff from the drone sector for six months, raising talent-monopoly concerns.\n## Society & Livelihood\n- **TV Boot Ads Officially Banned**: China's radio regulator banned mandatory TV boot ads, giving viewers a cleaner startup experience.\n## AI & Tech\n- **People's Daily Warns Against AI Diagnosis**: State media warned that large language models cannot replace professional doctors for medical advice.\n- **OpenAI Publishes Major Physics Paper**: OpenAI's new paper demonstrates AI-assisted physics discovery, signaling a fresh paradigm for basic science.\n## Global Perspective\n- **Pakistani Astronaut Joins Tiangong**: Pakistan became the first country to send an astronaut to China's space station, deepening bilateral space ties."
